{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37164","headline":"宿麻平驿 · 顾在熔","name":"宿麻平驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"及到怡情处，暂忘登陟劳。\n青山看不厌，明月坐来高。\n犬爲孤村吠，猨因冷木号。\n微吟还独酌，多兴忆同袍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾在熔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}